            "text": " \n                                                                 16 September 2026    \nDragami Games, LTD \n \n \n \n \n \n \nThe latest entry in the LOLLIPOP CHAINSAW series is officially titled LOLLIPOP CHAINSAW 2 \nBack2Back. To celebrate the announcement, a 2nd anniversary sale for LOLLIPOP CHAINSAW \nRePOP will begin on September 16, 2026. \n \nDragami Games Co., Ltd. (Headquarters: Shinagawa-ku, Tokyo; President and CEO: Shohei Sato) \ntoday announced that the latest entry in the LOLLIPOP CHAINSAW series is officially titled LOLLIPOP \nCHAINSAW 2 Back2Back and will be released for PlayStation®5. The announcement follows a reveal \nby NADA HOLDINGS CORP. (Headquarters: Taipei, Taiwan; President: Joe Teng; hereinafter “NADA \nHOLDINGS”) on the PlayStation.Blog. \n \nAbout LOLLIPOP CHAINSAW 2 Back2Back \nThe pop and cute high school zombie hunter who took the world by storm is back! \nOfficial Title Announcement for the Latest Entry in the \nLOLLIPOP CHAINSAW Series! \n“LOLLIPOP CHAINSAW 2 Back2Back ” \nNEWS RELEASE \n\n \nLOLLIPOP CHAINSAW 2 Back2Back is an all-new title in the LOLLIPOP CHAINSAW series. Juliet \nreturns in a brand-new outfit and with even more power, ready to take on another zombie-slaying \nadventure. Stay tuned for more information ahead of its planned 2027 release. \n \nLOLLIPOP CHAINSAW RePOP 2nd Anniversary Sale Starts! \nLOLLIPOP CHAINSAW RePOP celebrated its second anniversary on September 12. To commemorate \nthe official title reveal of LOLLIPOP CHAINSAW 2 Back2Back, a special sale for LOLLIPOP \nCHAINSAW RePOP will begin on September 17, offering discounts of up to 45% off.\n \nBefore playing LOLLIPOP CHAINSAW 2 Back2Back, revisit Juliet’s original adventure and experience \nthe series’ signature blend of pop style, dark humor, and fast-paced zombie-slaying action. \n\n \n【Sale Period】 \nXbox Series X|S / Xbox One \n・September 16, 2026, 5:00 PM – October 15, 2026, 4:59 PM (PDT) \n \nSteam \n・September 16, 2026, 10:00 AM – September 30, 2026, 10:00 AM (PDT) \n \nSales for PlayStation®5, PlayStation®4, Nintendo Switch, Nintendo Switch 2 Edition, and GOG.com \nare planned to begin later. \n \n*For details regarding the Japanese domestic stores, please refer to the Japanese press release. \n \n \nProduct information \n・Product Title : \"LOLLIPOP CHAINSAW RePOP\" \n・Genre  : Action \n・Release date : Now available \n・Price  : $44.99- \n・Players  : 1 \n・Platforms  : PlayStation®5、PlayStation®4、Xbox Series X|S、Xbox One、 \nNintendo Switch、PC（Steam、GOG、DLsite） \n・Voice Languages : English, Japanese \n・Text Languages : English, Japanese, French, Italian, German, Spanish,  \nLatin American Spanish, Brazilian Portuguese, Traditional Chinese \n・Publisher  : Dragami Games, Ltd. \n・Development : Dragami Games, Ltd. and Original Staff \n・Official website ：https://repop.lollipopchainsaw.com/en/ \n \n・Product Title : \"LOLLIPOP CHAINSAW RePOP Nintendo Switch 2 Edition\" \n・Genre  : Action \n・Release date : Now available \n・Price  : $49.99- / Upgrade Pass: $4.99- \n・Players  : 1 \n・Platforms  : Nintendo Switch 2 \n・Voice Languages : English, Japanese \n・Text Languages : English, Japanese, Korean, French, Italian, German, Spanish,  \nLatin American Spanish, Brazilian Portuguese, Traditional Chinese \n・Publisher  : Dragami Games, Ltd. \n・Development : Dragami Games, Ltd. and Original Staff \n・Official website ：https://repop.lollipopchainsaw.com/en/ \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n",
