            "text": "\" KINGDOM HEARTS IV RELEASING IN LATE 2027 \" - Square Enix North America Press Hub \n Skip to main content \n Close video player \n End of video player \n Close lightbox \n View previous image \n View next image \n Download \n Toggle navigation \n Latest \n Press Hub Home \n Products \n Release schedule \n Products A to Z \n Brands \n DRAGON QUEST \n FINAL FANTASY \n HITMAN \n JUST CAUSE \n KINGDOM HEARTS \n Life Is Strange \n MANA \n MERCHANDISE \n NieR \n PARANORMASIGHT \n SaGa \n Star Ocean \n TOMB RAIDER \n Other \n Contact us \n Register \n Log in \n Log in \n Remember me \n Forgotten username or password? \n EN \n North America \n LATAM \n Brazil \n Home \n Announcements \n KINGDOM HEARTS IV RELEASING IN LATE 2027 \n Press release \n 8/15/2026 \n Supporting image for KINGDOM HEARTS IV Press release \n KINGDOM HEARTS IV RELEASING IN LATE 2027 \n New D23 Trailer Reveals A Vibrant World Inspired by Disney and Pixar’s Coco \n LOS ANGELES (Aug. 1 5 , 2026) &ndash; During D23: The Ultimate Disney Fan Event 2026, SQUARE ENIX and Disney & Pixar Games announced that the highly anticipated action-RPG KINGDOM HEARTS IV will release in late 2027 with a new trailer debuting at the Disney Entertainment Showcase, revealing the new in-game world inspired by Disney and Pixar&rsquo;s Coco . Alongside this announcement, it was announced that 'Kingdom Hearts' (working title), an original anime series for Disney Channel and Disney+, is in development in collaboration with Tetsuya Nomura and the creative team at SQUARE ENIX. \n A panel during D23 titled DEEP DIVE into KINGDOM HEARTS commemorated 25 years of the franchise, discussing how the saga united Disney, Pixar, and SQUARE ENIX, with insights from the creative minds, character voice talent and more. The panel was livestreamed to audiences around the world and unveiled an extended trailer of KINGDOM HEARTS IV for fans to enjoy. \n To watch the extended KINGDOM HEARTS IV D23 trailer, visit: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lybMpYeO9L8 \n KINGDOM HEARTS IV follows protagonist Sora and some familiar characters as they journey though the mysterious city of Quadratum, where dark creatures known as the Heartless are causing havoc. In the next chapter of the beloved series, Sora will once again journey to various worlds inspired by Disney and Pixar, where new figures cross his path and new powers awaken. \n This new trailer revealed a plethora of new information about KINGDOM HEARTS IV , including the return of familiar faces like Sora&rsquo;s friends Donald Duck and Goofy. Fans will be able to play as Mickey Mouse, Donald Duck and Goofy as they seek to uncover information about Sora&rsquo;s whereabouts. \n KINGDOM HEARTS IV will be available for Nintendo Switch&trade; 2, PlayStation&reg;5, XBOX Series X|S and PC in late 2027 and is available to wish list now. For more information, visit: https://www.kingdomhearts.com/ \n Related Links: \n Official Website: https://www.kingdomhearts.com/ \n X (previously Twitter): https://x.com/KingdomHearts \n Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/KingdomHearts \n YouTube: https://www.youtube.com/KingdomHearts \n Instagram: https://instagram.com/KingdomHearts \n #KingdomHearts \n About the KINGDOM HEARTS Series \n KINGDOM HEARTS is a series of role-playing games created through the collaboration of Disney and Square Enix. Since the first KINGDOM HEARTS was released in March 2002 for the PlayStation&reg;2 computer entertainment system, the series has expanded with several additional entries. The series has shipped over 39 million units worldwide. \n About Square Enix, Inc. \n Ranked as the #1 Publisher of the Year in 2025 by Metacritic. \n Square Enix, Inc. develops, publishes, distributes and licenses SQUARE ENIX and TAITO branded entertainment content throughout the Americas as part of the Square Enix group of companies. The Square Enix group of companies boasts a valuable portfolio of intellectual property including: FINAL FANTASY, which has sold over 212 million units worldwide; DRAGON QUEST, which has sold over 97 million units worldwide; and the legendary SPACE INVADERS. Square Enix, Inc. is a U.S.-based, wholly owned subsidiary of Square Enix Holdings Co., Ltd. \n More information on Square Enix, Inc. can be found at https://square-enix-games.com \n # # # \n KINGDOM HEARTS &copy; Disney. &copy; Disney/Pixar. Developed by SQUARE ENIX. \n Nintendo Switch is a trademark of Nintendo. XBOX Series X|S, the Games for Windows logo and XBOX logos are registered trademarks or trademarks of the Microsoft group of companies and are used under license. \n All other trademarks are properties of their respective owners. \n More information \n Product links \n KINGDOM HEARTS IV \n Contact \n Chad Concelmo\n SENIOR PR MANAGER\n cconcelmo@us.square-enix.com \n Kat Prodromou\n PR Manager\n kprodromou@us.square-enix.com \n Assets \n Trailers/videos on this page may only be displayed behind an age-gate that: (1) is age-neutral (i.e., requires the user to input their date of birth or select it from a drop-down bar; (2) employs reasonable technical measures to keep underage users from re-entering their age after initially being denied access; and (3) does not display any ESRB rating information on the video player or the age-gate itself. Failure to implement these requirements may jeopardize your ability to obtain material of this nature from us in the future. \n Download 0 items \n Zip content limit reached! \n Add set to downloads \n D23 Trailer Screenshots\n More \n Register \n Company Information and Assets \n Terms and Conditions \n Privacy Policy \n Press site by \n &copy; 2020 SQUARE ENIX LTD. All Rights Reserved. SQUARE ENIX and the SQUARE ENIX logo are trademarks or registered trademarks of Square Enix Holdings Co., Ltd.\n Square Enix, Inc., 999 N. Pacific Coast Highway, 3rd Floor, El Segundo, CA 90245\n This is taking longer than usual to load. \n Retry \n Close \n Your downloads \n Total download size: \n Clear list \n Download \n [ More ...]",
