            "text": "TOKYO GAME SHOW 2026 | KOEI TECMO GAMES \n TOKYO GAME SHOW 2026\nFOLLOW US\n X Facebook YouTube \n English(US) \n 日本語 English(US) 繁體中文 \n Top\n Titles\n Online\n Booth\n Merchandise\nFOLLOW US\n X Facebook YouTube \n English(US) \n 日本語 English(US) 繁體中文 \n Titles\n Attack on Titan 3 / A.O.T. 3 \n Attack on Titan 3 / A.O.T. 3\n Release: 12/10/2026 \n PlayStation®5 / Nintendo Switch™ 2 / XBOX Series X|S / Steam®\n Official Site Playable Demos / Booth / Stage\n Booth\n Demo \n Demo\n New action brings even more freedom powered by the omni-directional mobility gear, delivering a one-of-a-kind combat experience. Titans will be more terrifying and dangerous than ever before, with new attacks and behaviors that will force players to fight relentlessly for their survival.\n Screenshots are taken from an in-development build.\n Giant Colossal Titan Balloon \n Giant Colossal Titan Balloon\n Appearance of a life-size balloon of the Colossal Titan's head!\n Images are not final.\n Original Film-Style Bookmark (5 designs) \n Original Film-Style Bookmark (5 designs)\n Presents for attendees who try out Attack on Titan 3 / A.O.T. 3 at the KOEI TECMO booth.\n One item per demo play session.\n Please be aware that designs are distributed randomly and cannot be selected.\n Giveaways are available in limited quantities, while supplies last.\n Images are not final.\n STAGE\n Attack on Titan 3 / A.O.T. 3 Latest Information Announcement Stage \n Attack on Titan 3 / A.O.T. 3 Latest Information Announcement Stage\n 9/18 (Fri) 15:40–16:20 JST \n A special stage for Attack on Titan 3 / A.O.T. 3, a tactical hunting action game scheduled to launch on 12/10, will be held. The development team will introduce console gameplay and share the latest information, including day-to-day life inside the Walls and interactions with comrades.\nCast:\nHideo Suzuki (Development Producer for Attack on Titan 3 / A.O.T. 3)\nHayato Iwata (Director for Attack on Titan 3 / A.O.T. 3)\n Livestream：\n YouTube X \n Start times may vary.\n New OP Anime Info Reveal at the Attack on Titan 3 / A.O.T. 3 Voice Actor Stage \n New OP Anime Info Reveal at the Attack on Titan 3 / A.O.T. 3 Voice Actor Stage\n 9/20 (Sun) 15:40–16:20 JST \n A special stage for Attack on Titan 3 / A.O.T. 3, a tactical hunting action game scheduled to launch on 12/10, will be held. Along with special guests, attendees can hear stories about memorable scenes and the latest information on MAPPA’s opening animation.\nCast:\nYuu Kobayashi (Sasha)\nEori Mikami (Crista)\nHideo Suzuki (Producer for Attack on Titan 3 / A.O.T. 3)\n Livestream：\n YouTube X \n Start times may vary.\n TOKYO GAME SHOW 2026 Official Site \n Makuhari Messe\n BUSINESS DAYS: 9/17 Thu - 9/18 Fri / PUBLIC DAYS: 9/19 Sat - 9/21 Mon\n FOLLOW US \n X Facebook YouTube \n Based on the manga “Shingeki no Kyojin” by Hajime Isayama originally serialized in the monthly BESSATSU SHONEN MAGAZINE published by KODANSHA Ltd. \n©Hajime Isayama, KODANSHA/“ATTACK ON TITAN” The Final Season Production Committee. \n©2026 KOEI TECMO GAMES CO., LTD.\n©Hyuganatsu, Imagica Infos/\"The Apothecary Diaries\"Project\n©2026 \"The Apothecary Diaries\" The Movie Project ©Hyuganatsu, Imagica Infos\n©KOEI TECMO GAMES CO., LTD./TOHO, CO., LTD.",
