            "contentType": "text/html; charset=UTF-8",
            "title": "KOEI TECMO Locks in Dec. 10, 2026 Release Date for Attack on Titan 3 - KOEI TECMO AMERICA",
            "text": "KOEI TECMO Locks in Dec. 10, 2026 Release Date for Attack on Titan 3 - KOEI TECMO AMERICA \n Games \n What’s New \n Company \n Support \n KOEI TECMO Locks in Dec. 10, 2026 Release Date for Attack on Titan 3 \n Home \n KOEI TECMO Locks in Dec. 10, 2026 Release Date for Attack on Titan 3 \n KTA \n Attack on Titan \n 08/03/2026 \n KOEI TECMO Locks in Dec. 10, 2026 Release Date for Attack on Titan 3\n Share \n Fans can now Pre-order the Game in Both Digital and Physical Versions* \n BURLINGAME, Calif. –   Aug. 4, 2026  – Today, KOEI TECMO America and developer Omega Force announced that  Attack on Titan 3 , the latest installment in the Attack on Titan  action game series, will be released Dec. 10, 2026 for the PlayStation®5, Nintendo Switch™ 2, XBOX Series X|S and PC Windows via Steam®.\n Watch the new trailer on  YouTube \n Attack on Titan 3  is the riveting culmination of Omega Force’s action game series, depicting the story of  Attack on Titan  from its survey corps beginnings to its dramatic conclusion.   In this title, fans will dive into the action by taking on the role of a member of the Scout Regiment to relive the historical events that shaped the world alongside the iconic cast of  Attack of Titan . \n In addition to the standard edition available in digital and physical format, fans can pre-order a special Steelbook™ launch edition with ICONART on all physical platforms. A Digital Deluxe Edition is also available to pre-order, and features the base game, the Digital Artbook, a character customization pack, an original equipment pack, a starter item pack, and a 72-hour Early Access key**. \n Players who pre-order a digital copy of the game will receive the “Wings of Freedom Earrings” customization item as a digital pre-order bonus, while everyone who purchases a physical or digital copy of the game*** will receive the “Wings of Freedom Hoodie” customization item as an early purchase bonus. \n All players with existing  Attack on Titan 2 or  Attack on Titan 2: Final Battle  save data will receive additional in-game bonuses (saved data must be stored on the same console used to play  Attack on Titan 3 ). More details will be shared at a later date. \n Attack on Titan 3  is currently in development and is scheduled to release Dec. 10, 2026 on PlayStation®5, Nintendo Switch™ 2, XBOX Series X|S and PC Windows via Steam®. The game will include Japanese voices with texts in English, French, Italian, German and Spanish. \n For more information on  Attack on Titan 3 , be sure to visit the  official site ,  Attack on Titan  Game Series Official  X , subscribe to the official KOEI TECMO America  YouTube  channel, like us on  Facebook , and follow us on  X ,  Instagram , and  Discord .\n *Digital pre-orders for Nintendo Switch™ 2 version will start at a later date. \n ** The Nintendo Switch™ 2 version and Upgrade Pack do not include the Early Access key. \n *** For physical copies, only applies to first production run. For digital copies, available with every purchase made by Dec. 23, 2026. \n Check out the game! \n Coming Soon \n Omega Force \n Attack on Titan 3 \n PS5 \n Steam \n Switch 2 \n Xbox Series X | S \n More News\n 07/01/2026 \n Feel the Power of the Final Titan Showdown in KOEI TECMO’s Attack on Titan 3, Coming This Winter \n KTA \n Attack on Titan \n 06/05/2026 \n Experience the World-renowned Epic of Attack on Titan from Beginning to End in KOEI TECMO’s Attack on Titan 3, Coming Soon from Omega Force! \n KTA \n Attack on Titan \n Games \n Company \n Support \n Privacy Policy \n Cookies Policy \n Do Not Sell My Personal Information \n Follow us on our social channels! \n Copyright ©2026 KOEI TECMO GAMES CO., LTD. All Rights Reserved.",
