            "title": "Buy JUJUTSU KAISEN RUMBLE: SURVIVATON | XBOX",
            "text": "Buy JUJUTSU KAISEN RUMBLE: SURVIVATON | XBOX \n Skip to main content \n Microsoft \n Xbox \n Join Game Pass \n Browse Games \n Deals with Game Pass \n Games home \n Shop all console games \n Shop all PC games \n XBOX Play Anywhere \n Free-to-Play games \n Optimised for XBOX Series X|S \n Backward compatible games \n Sales & Specials \n Redeem Code \n Explore all devices \n Shop all accessories \n Controllers \n Design your controller \n Headsets \n Hard drives & storage \n Mobile gaming accessories \n Where to buy \n XBOX Series X \n XBOX Series S \n XBOX on PC \n XBOX on handhelds \n Shop Games \n Shop Game Pass \n Shop Consoles \n Shop Accessories \n Shop Deals \n XBOX 25th Anniversary \n FanFest \n Our philosophy \n Family hub \n XBOX Family Settings app \n Accessible gaming \n Community standards \n XBOX Gear \n XBOX Game Studios \n Support home \n XBOX status \n Account & profile \n Subscriptions & billing \n Hardware & networking \n Family & online safety \n Games & apps \n Friends & social activity \n Accessible gaming \n XBOX system updates \n Games \n Microsoft 365 \n Azure \n Copilot \n Windows \n Surface \n XBOX \n Sale \n Small Business \n Support \n Windows Apps \n OneDrive \n Outlook \n Moving from Skype to Teams \n OneNote \n Microsoft Teams \n Shop XBOX \n Accessories \n XBOX Game Pass Ultimate \n XBOX games \n PC games \n Microsoft AI \n Microsoft Security \n Azure \n Dynamics 365 \n Microsoft 365 for business \n Microsoft Power Platform \n Windows 365 \n Digital Sovereignty \n Microsoft Developer \n Microsoft Learn \n Support for AI marketplace apps \n Microsoft Tech Community \n Microsoft Marketplace \n Software companies \n Visual Studio \n Microsoft Rewards \n Free downloads & security \n Education \n Gift cards \n Licensing \n View Sitemap \n JUJUTSU KAISEN RUMBLE: SURVIVATON \n JUJUTSU KAISEN RUMBLE: SURVIVATON \n JUJUTSU KAISEN RUMBLE: SURVIVATON\n SHUEISHA GAMES • Other \n Optimised for XBOX Series X|S \n Optimised for XBOX Series X|S \n Optimised for XBOX Series X|S \n Optimised for XBOX Series X|S \n For ages 7 and up 7+ Implied Violence\n Publishers of games you launch receive access to your XBOX profile information and associated data while you play. Learn more \n DETAILS \n REVIEWS \n MORE \n Description\n About JUJUTSU KAISEN RUMBLE: SURVIVATON\nFrom the creator of Vampire Survivors Luca Galante and Shueisha Games, a new take on the genre. A poncle production set in the world of Jujutsu Kaisen, creating a new genre.\nSurvive, Exorcise, Change the game\nJUJUTSU KAISEN RUMBLE: SURVIVATON is a survivors royale where you battle cursed spirits, rivals, and grow stronger throughout the match. Outscore other contestants on your way to the final showdown.\nDefeat enemies, build your loadout, unlock rule-changing effects, and fight to become the last player standing victorious.\nOnline play supports up to 8 players. Solo play mode available.\n◆ Earn Points and Overwhelm Your Rivals!\nCut through waves of cursed spirits, rack up points, and keep pace with your rivals' as the match grows more intense.\nYour attacks trigger automatically, so the focus is on movement, positioning, and choosing the right moment to strike back with rule-changing effects.\nAt 100 points, activate a \"\"Rule Addition\"\" to disrupt your opponents, steal momentum, and climb the rankings.\nIn the end, the top 2 players face off in a 1v1 duel, where only one will emerge victorious.\n◆ A roster of 20＋ characters from Jujutsu Kaisen!\nPlay as 20+ characters from the world of Jujutsu Kaisen, each with their own skills and playstyle.\nUnlock new fighters by meeting specific conditions, experiment with different strengths, and find the character that fits your approach.\nPowerful BOSSES can also appear mid-battle, turning the match into an even more chaotic clash of Jujutsu Sorcerers, Curse Users, and Cursed Spirits.\n◆ Overwhelm Your Rivals with Unique Special Moves\nBuild up your gauge in battle, then unleash devastating character-specific techniques at the perfect moment.\nActivate techniques iconic to JUJUTSU KAISEN from Domain Expansion, Black Flash, and beyond. These powerful moves can turn the tide of a match in an instant.\nSpecial Moves can expose nearby rivals and can be directly targeted to a variety of game-altering attacks from the caster for the duration.\n◆ Every Choice is Yours. Skills That Change with Every Run.\nCollect EXP from defeated cursed spirits and level up throughout the match.\nEach level gives you new skill options to shape your build on the fly: strengthen what you already have, add new abilities, and discover powerful synergies that can carry you to victory.\n◆About JUJUTSU KAISEN\nCreated by Gege Akutami, JUJUTSU KAISEN was serialized in Weekly Shonen Jump from Issue 14 of 2018 (March 5, 2018) through Issue 44 of 2024 (September 30, 2024), spanning 30 volumes. Curses. Sinister forces born from negative human emotions, such as hardship, regret, and shame, are driving people toward death. When the seal on a powerful “Cursed Object” is broken, high school student Yuji Itadori steps into a world of battles surrounding curses...! A groundbreaking new frontier in dark fantasy, opened by a singular talent!\nThe manga spans 30 volumes, with Volume 0 also available as JUJUTSU KAISEN 0: Tokyo Metropolitan Curse Technical School. The series has surpassed 150 million copies incirculation (including digital editions)Worldwide.  Season 1 of the TV anime aired from October 2020 to March 2021. Released in December 2021, JUJUTSU KAISEN 0: The Movie became a major hit, grossing 26.5 billion yen worldwide and becoming a cultural phenomenon. Season 2 of the TV anime, which aired from July to December 2023, was also widely acclaimed for its exceptional quality. In May 2025, JUJUTSU KAISEN: Hidden Inventory / Premature Death was released theatrically as a compilation film. That October saw a theatrical re-release of JUJUTSU KAISEN 0, followed in November by the theatrical release of JUJUTSU KAISEN: Execution. Season 3 of the TV anime, JUJUTSU KAISEN: Culling Game Part 1, aired from January to late March 2026.\nJUJUTSU KAISEN Official X: @jujutsu_PR\nJUJUTSU KAISEN Anime Official Website: https://jujutsukaisen.jp/\n Show more \n Published by\n SHUEISHA GAMES\n Developed by\n Poncle\n Play with\n PC\n XBOX Series X|S\n Capabilities\n Optimized for Xbox Series X|S\n XBOX consoles \n XBOX games \n XBOX Game Pass \n XBOX accessories \n XBOX Support \n Feedback \n Community Standards \n Photosensitive Seizure Warning \n Microsoft account \n Microsoft Store Support \n Returns \n Orders tracking \n Games \n English (Singapore) \n Your Privacy Choices \n Consumer Health Privacy \n Contact Microsoft \n Privacy & Cookies \n Manage cookies \n Terms of use \n Trademarks \n Third Party Notices \n About our ads",
