            "text": "Muv-Luv: Tactics Kalidasa at Nightmare Steam store page & Discord server now open! | Muv-Luv Portal \n Muv-Luv Portal \n NEWS \n PRODUCTS \n WORLD-GUIDE \n NEWS\n Muv-Luv: Tactics Kalidasa at Nightmare Steam store page & Discord server now open!\n 2026.06.24\n GAME \n SHARE\n We are pleased to announce that the Steam store page for Muv-Luv: Tactics Kalidasa at Nightmare, a tactical simulation RPG that inherits the spirit of the Muv-Luv series, is now live!\nThe Steam version of this title will be published by aNCHOR.\n Alongside the launch of the store page, we have also opened the official Discord server!\nWe sincerely look forward to your visit and participation.\n ▼Steam store page:\n https://store.steampowered.com/app/4372780/MuvLuvTactics_kalidasa_at_nightmare/ \n ▼Discord server:\n https://discord.gg/gPDNyWUS2 \n ▼Promotion Movie:\n https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hQ3qPB-qrrU \n The official website is also scheduled to open soon!\nAdd the game to your wishlist, join the Discord server, and look forward to its 2027 release!\n 【Product Information】\nMuv-Luv: Tactics Kalidasa at Nightmare\nGenre: Simulation RPG\nRelease Date: Scheduled for 2027\nSupported Languages: Japanese / English / Traditional Chinese / Simplified Chinese\nDeveloper: fuzz\nPublisher: aNCHOR\n PREV \n NEXT \n HOME \n âge \n aNCHOR \n aNTIQ \n SHARE\n © Muv-Luv: The Answer\n TOP \n NEWS \n PRODUCTS \n GAMES\n BOOKS\n CD/DVD\n WORLD-GUIDE \n Background\n TSFs / BETA\n Probability Spacetime\n SUPPORT \n PRIVACY POLICY \n IP GUIDELINE \n 日本語 \n English\n LOADING...",
