            "text": "KINGDOM HEARTS IV for Nintendo Switch 2 - Nintendo Official Site Skip to main content Nintendo \n Explore \n Shop \n Support \n Nintendo \n Search Loading \n Region and language selector. Currently: USA. \n Nintendo Switch 2 \n Nintendo Switch \n Games \n Nintendo Switch Online \n News and events Play Nintendo My Nintendo Apps My Mario \n Meet the characters:\n Super Mario \n The Legend of Zelda \n Splatoon \n Kirby \n Pikmin \n Animal Crossing \n Metroid \n Nintendo Store Shop all \n Games Hardware Merchandise Sales and deals Exclusives Characters \n Support Get help now \n My Support Dashboard Accounts & Purchases Nintendo Switch 2 Nintendo Switch Nintendo Switch Online Apps & Other Products Service Center \n Nintendo \n Nintendo Region and language selector. Currently: USA. \n Home \n Nintendo Store \n Games \n KINGDOM HEARTS IV \n Slide 1 of 7\n KINGDOM HEARTS IV 1 \n KINGDOM HEARTS IV 3 \n KINGDOM HEARTS IV 4 \n KINGDOM HEARTS IV 5 \n KINGDOM HEARTS IV 6 \n KINGDOM HEARTS IV 7 \n KINGDOM HEARTS IV 1 \n KINGDOM HEARTS IV 3 \n KINGDOM HEARTS IV 4 \n KINGDOM HEARTS IV 5 \n KINGDOM HEARTS IV 6 \n KINGDOM HEARTS IV 7 \n KINGDOM HEARTS IV 1 \n KINGDOM HEARTS IV 3 \n KINGDOM HEARTS IV 4 \n KINGDOM HEARTS IV 5 \n KINGDOM HEARTS IV 6 \n KINGDOM HEARTS IV 7 \n KINGDOM HEARTS IV 1 \n KINGDOM HEARTS IV 3 \n KINGDOM HEARTS IV 4 \n KINGDOM HEARTS IV 5 \n KINGDOM HEARTS IV 6 \n KINGDOM HEARTS IV 7 \n Visit www.esrb.org for rating information.\n Games \n KINGDOM HEARTS IV\n Version\n Nintendo Switch 2\n Edition\n Digital\n Visit www.esrb.org for rating information.\n Loading \n An action-packed new addition to the KINGDOM HEARTS series.\n As the KINGDOM HEARTS series approaches its 25th anniversary, a new adventure begins.\nOur hero Sora awakes in the unfamiliar world of Quadratum. As he looks for a way to return from this modern metropolis to his own world, his friends Donald and Goofy head for the Underworld in hopes of finding a clue to his whereabouts.\nThe dynamic, fast-paced battle system allows you to effortlessly combine attacks and magic, as well as build combos with a brand-new battle feature.\nChange the Keyblade Sora wields to unleash unique attacks, matching the flow of battle to your own strategies and play style.\n Software description provided by the publisher.\n KINGDOM HEARTS IV \n About this item\n No. of players\n Single system (1) \n System\n Nintendo Switch 2 \n Publisher\n SQUARE ENIX \n Supported languages\n Japanese, French, German, Italian, Spanish, Latin American Spanish, Brazilian Portuguese, American English\n Release date\n 2027\n ESRB rating\n Visit www.esrb.org for rating information.\n WARNING: If you have epilepsy or have had seizures or other unusual reactions to flashing lights or patterns, consult a doctor before playing video games. All users should read the Health and Safety Information available in the system settings before using this software.\n About Nintendo \n Careers \n Sustainability \n Shop \n Games \n Hardware \n Merchandise \n Sales and deals \n Exclusives \n Nintendo Switch Online \n Nintendo retail locations \n Orders \n Order details \n Shipping info \n Refunds and returns \n FAQ \n Support \n Nintendo Switch 2 \n Nintendo Switch \n Nintendo Account \n Apps and other products \n Service center \n Nintendo product recycling \n Warranty \n Licensed product information \n Parents \n Info for parents \n Parental controls \n Privacy \n Privacy policy \n Cookies and interest-based ads \n Community \n Community guidelines \n Online safety \n Documents and policies \n Health and safety precautions \n Wireless regulatory info \n Supply chain transparency \n © Nintendo. Games are property of their respective owners. Nintendo of America Inc. Headquarters are in Redmond, Washington, USA \n Contact us Website feedback Terms of Use \n Region and language selector. Currently: USA. English (United States)",
