            "text": "Monster Hunter Outlanders - Apps on Google Play \n Games\n Apps\n Movies & TV\n Books\n Kids\n google_logo Play Games \n Apps \n Movies & TV \n Books \n Kids \n none \n search \n help_outline \n Sign in with Google \n play_apps Library & devices \n payment Payments & subscriptions \n reviews My Play activity \n redeem Offers \n Play Pass \n storefront Third-party app stores \n Personalization in Play \n settings Settings \n Privacy Policy • Terms of Service \n Games\n Apps\n Movies & TV\n Books\n Kids\n Icon image \n Icon image Monster Hunter Outlanders \n Level Infinite \n In-app purchases \n Content rating \n Teen info \n Share \n Add to wishlist \n Content rating Teen\n Violence, Blood\n Users Interact, In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\n Learn more \n Screenshot image \n Screenshot image \n Screenshot image \n Screenshot image \n Screenshot image \n Screenshot image \n Screenshot image \n Screenshot image \n Screenshot image \n Screenshot image \n Screenshot image \n Screenshot image \n Screenshot image \n Screenshot image \n Screenshot image \n Screenshot image \n Screenshot image \n Screenshot image \n About this game\n arrow_forward \n Monster Hunter Outlanders is a Monster Hunter exploration hunting action game on mobile, officially licensed by CAPCOM and developed by TiMi Studio Group. The game preserves the classic weapons and hunting experience the IP is known for, while introducing a brand-new world, original Adventurers, Buddies, and exclusive new Monsters.\n① Hunt & Explore in the Living Aesoland.\nA new adventure awaits on your phone! Built for mobile play, with portable controls that allow you to dive into the action instantly!\n② Epic Elder Dragons & Exclusive Radiant Species, Only in Monster Hunter Outlanders.\nWrapped in a dazzling radiance, the Elder Dragon Ruger Aidal descends like a blazing sun!\nShaped by the ever-changing environment, Radiant Monsters are here to bring new adventures and challenges!\n③ No Quest is Too Great, Team Up Anytime! \nExplore the vast field solo, or rally your friends with a single tap to form a 4-player hunting squad. No matter when or where, as long as you've got companions by your side, no monster is too fearsome to face!\n④ Original Adventurers & Classic Weapons, Unleash All-new Hunting Arts\nThe seven classic weapon types are here: Great Sword, Long Sword, Dual Blades, Hammer, Lance, Heavy Bowgun, and Bow. Each weapon forms a unique combination with Adventurers, preserving the core hunting experience while unlocking all-new Follow-up moves! More weapons will join the hunt in future updates.\n⑤ Meet New Buddies.\nPalico, Rutaco, and Trillan—three Buddies, each with their own unique personality—will join you on the hunt, adding color to your adventure through a wealth of events and happenings.\n⑥ Born For Mobile. \nFaithful recreations of the series' classic weapons and hunting gameplay, deeply optimized for mobile devices to deliver a smoother, more freeform experience—hunt wherever, whenever!\nPre-register Now and Happy Hunting!\n Hunt & Explore, A New Adventure Awaits on Your Phone.\n Updated on\n Oct 6, 2026\n Monster \n Featured stories \n Special event\n Play Fest starts on October 13\n Big savings, big offers, and more\n Data safety\n arrow_forward \n Safety starts with understanding how developers collect and share your data. Data privacy and security practices may vary based on your use, region, and age. The developer provided this information and may update it over time. Icon image This app may share these data types with third parties Device or other IDs\n Icon image This app may collect these data types Personal info\n Icon image Data is encrypted in transit\n Icon image You can request that data be deleted\n See details \n flag Flag as inappropriate \n Content rating Teen\n Violence, Blood\n Users Interact, In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\n Learn more \n App support\n expand_more \n email Support email\n support@monsterhunteroutlanders.com\n shield Privacy Policy\n About the developer\n PROXIMA BETA PTE. LIMITED \n proximabeta8@gmail.com \n C/O: PB CORPORATE SERVICES PTE LTD\n10 Anson Road\nSingapore 079903 \n +65 6904 1802 \n More by Level Infinite \n arrow_forward \n Thumbnail image PUBG MOBILE \n Level Infinite \n 4.3 star \n Thumbnail image Delta Force: 2nd Anniversary \n Level Infinite \n 4.3 star \n Thumbnail image Crownstone Survival \n Level Infinite \n Thumbnail image Honor of Kings \n Level Infinite \n 4.1 star \n Thumbnail image Rust Mobile \n Level Infinite \n Thumbnail image Age of Empires Mobile \n Level Infinite \n 4.1 star \n Similar games \n arrow_forward \n Thumbnail image Monster Hunter Now \n Scopely Explore, Inc. \n 4.5 star \n Thumbnail image Monster Hunter Stories \n CAPCOM CO., LTD. \n 4.1 star \n $19.99 \n Thumbnail image Onmyoji Arena \n NetEase Games \n 4.2 star \n Thumbnail image Legend of Mana \n SQUARE ENIX Co.,Ltd. \n 3.7 star \n $27.99 \n Thumbnail image Greak: Memories of Azur \n Navegante \n 4.4 star \n $4.99 \n Thumbnail image World of Kungfu: Dragon&Eagle \n ChillyRoom \n 4.5 star \n flag Flag as inappropriate \n Google Play Play Pass\n Play Points\n Gift cards\n Redeem\n Refund policy\n Kids & family Parent Guide\n Family sharing\n Terms of Service\n Privacy\n About Google Play\n Developers\n Google Store\n United States (English)",
